@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 185
skinparam ArrowColor #526C80
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #93AABC
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F5F8FA
skinparam nodesep 42
skinparam ranksep 44
rectangle "运行程序" as Runtime #E6F1FC
rectangle "模型" as Model
rectangle "工具" as Tool
rectangle "任务状态" as State
rectangle "长期记忆（可选）" as Memory
Model -right-> Runtime : 答复或工具请求
Runtime -left-> Model : 本轮上下文
Runtime -right-> Tool : 获准的调用
Tool -left-> Runtime : 结果或错误
Runtime -down-> State : 记录进展
State -up-> Runtime : 当前进展
Memory -up-> Runtime : 取回的历史信息
State -[hidden]right-> Memory
@enduml
